TITLE Pyrite oxidation equilibrium with fixed atmospheric O2, allow goethite and gypsum
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7  10
    Pyrite   0    0.1
    Goethite 0    0
    Gypsum   0    0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file pyrite_ox.sel
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Fe3_aq_species
10 PUNCH TOT("Fe(+3)")
END
